@startuml c4-dynamic
title Dynamic view — one event from submission to CONFIRMED

autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 210
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor #438DD5
  FontColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #2E6DA4
}
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #444444
  LifeLineBorderColor #999999
  GroupBorderColor #999999
  GroupHeaderFontColor #444444
}

participant "Portal / ERP" as client
participant "Traceability App" as app
participant "Operational DB" as db
participant "Workers" as workers
participant "KMS" as kms #999999
participant "External Archive" as archive #999999
participant "Relayer" as relayer
participant "Blockchain" as chain #999999
participant "Public CDN" as cdn

== Phase 1 · Receive and validate (DRAFT → VALIDATED) ==
client -> app: Submit EPCIS event, SignatureEnvelope,\ncaptureRecordId, profile reference
app -> db: Validate; persist VALIDATED;\nenqueue archive intent in one transaction
note right of db: Idempotent on captureRecordId + digest;\nno receipt is issued yet

== Phase 2 · Encrypt and archive (→ PENDING_ARCHIVE) ==
workers -> db: Poll and claim the outbox intent
workers -> kms: Wrap the event DEK under the KEK epoch
kms --> workers: Wrapped DEK
workers -> archive: Put EncryptedArchiveEnvelope
archive --> workers: Signed ArchiveAck\nfor the bytes actually stored
note over kms, archive: Dedicated DEK per event.\nThe archive holder cannot decrypt;\nit only signs what it stored.

== Phase 3 · Acceptance receipt (receipt issued) ==
workers -> db: Record Ack; issue acceptance receipt
app --> client: Acceptance receipt\n(binds ArchiveAckDigest + payload digest)
note right of client: The platform has now committed\nto an anchor window. It cannot\nsilently drop the event.

== Phase 4 · Anchor and finality (PENDING_ANCHOR → FINALISED) ==
relayer -> db: Claim anchor intent; allocate\ndeterministic Merkle leaf
relayer -> chain: Submit batch Merkle root
chain --> relayer: Finality; transaction reference
relayer -> db: Record inclusion proof and leaf

== Phase 5 · Confirm and project (CONFIRMED) ==
workers -> db: Mark CONFIRMED
workers -> cdn: Publish versioned consumer projection
app --> client: Trace query now returns the confirmed event

note over workers, chain: Failure suspends the event in the state it reached and retries\nidempotently; a timeout never promotes it to CONFIRMED.

@enduml